    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>266528</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>雑貨屋　ゴーリ２号店</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>General Store - "Goalie" #2</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>雑貨屋ゴーリ２号店へ
ようこそ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcome to the general
store, "Goalie" #2.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269928</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何かほしいものが
あるのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is there anything
you're looking for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269932</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269936</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゴーリゴリの「ゴーリ」だよ
お忘れなきよう。
１号店もよろしくな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're called "Goalie" because we never
fail to catch the details. Do try to
remember that. And try visiting #1, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うーん……ないかなぁ
ないよなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm... They probably don't...
Yeah, I don't think they do...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269940</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ルヴォス１２って石なんだけど
君たち見たことないかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's this gemstone called Luvos-12.
Have you ever heard of it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さすがにルヴォス１２は
こんな田舎町の雑貨店には
ないよなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I should've known... It's a
rural general store, so of course
they don't have any Luvos-12...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269944</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>とあるものを作るための
原材料なんだけどね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>FYI, it's a base material to
create a certain something...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>people do use FYI in conversation
and i imagine this npc would be
the type to do it</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はバジル博士の提唱した
人工マナについての
研究をしているんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm conducting research
into artificial mana, of which
Basil was a proponent.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴァルハラも解放されたし、
そろそろ材料の
ルミネイト１２８も流通するかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Valhalla has been liberated, now,
so I imagine Luminate-128 should
be in circulation soon...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ルミネイト１２８、通称「紅の月」。
ルヴォス１２と融合反応させ
作るのが人工マナ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Luminate-128, common name "Crimson
Moon." When fused together with
Luvos-12, the product is artificial mana.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人工マナを使えば
人も魔術を紡げるように
なるかもというのがバジル理論ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>According to Basil's theory, if we use
artificial mana, even humans might
very well be enabled to weave magic.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>this line does NOT use Hakase/Professor;
also, the "weave" comes from an unusual
and similar choice of word in japanese</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジル博士が「シグルド」の
ブレイナーだったのは
ショックだったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It came as a shock to me that
Brynhildr, of "Sigurd," was
actually the professor, Basil.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジル博士にも色々と
無念な想いがあったんだろうね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Looks like even Basil had
quite a lot of bones to
pick with the world, eh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>亡くなったバジル博士の意思は
私が引き継ぐよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll carry on the
deceased professor's
work myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Basil-Hakase/Professor Basil</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>269960</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだまだ私など、
その足元に及びもしないけどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, some rando like me
doesn't even come close to
measuring up to him!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
